ssa che entra e esce furtivamente dall'ingresso riservato ai dipendenti. Ma è troppo intrigante per denunciarla. Fare un giro di prova della sua nuova idea di libro sembra un'opzione molto migliore."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"When romance novelist Kate Smith suddenly gets writer's block as she's beginning the final installment of her international bestselling steamy Bed 'n Breakfast series, she'll do pretty much anything to get her groove back. Like sneak into a Tire Depot waiting room because her words flow there just like complimentary coffee-smooth, sweet, and scorchingly hot. She manages to fly under the radar until the rugged and charming mechanic, Miles Hudson, notices the quirky redhead slinking in and out of the employees only entrance. But she's way too intriguing to blow the whistle on. Doing a test-drive of her new book idea sounds like a much better option."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k9j9WuiygyNzDtkG0A9lRpC8DEE.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ahyExEzUyhy5PZn1jqsHgXi0atx.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1046043,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k9j9WuiygyNzDtkG0A9lRpC8DEE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k9j9WuiygyNzDtkG0A9lRpC8DEE.jpg","language":"it","width":1920,"height":2560},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k9j9WuiygyNzDtkG0A9lRpC8DEE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k9j9WuiygyNzDtkG0A9lRpC8DEE.jpg","language":"it","width":1920,"height":2560}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/34cgjVoAIXVsZ2uZkTsdxWhv2Si.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/34cgjVoAIXVsZ2uZkTsdxWhv2Si.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":